%%{init: {'theme':'neutral', 'themeVariables': {'lineColor':'#94a3b8'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as MCP Client
    participant Transport as Transport Handler
    participant FastMCP as FastMCP
    participant Middleware as Middleware Chain
    participant Builder as Query Builder
    participant Backend as GraphQL Backend
    participant Normalizer as Result Normalizer
    
    Client->>Transport: tools/call {name, arguments}
    Transport->>FastMCP: Route to tool handler
    
    FastMCP->>Middleware: on_call_tool (hook)
    
    activate Middleware
    Middleware->>Middleware: Log call
    Middleware->>Middleware: Verify auth
    
    Middleware->>Builder: Build GraphQL query
    Builder->>Builder: Parse include paths
    Builder->>Builder: Build SelectionNode tree
    Builder-->>Middleware: GraphQL Query + Variables
    
    Middleware->>Backend: Execute query
    Backend-->>Middleware: JSON Result
    
    Middleware->>Normalizer: Normalize result
    Normalizer->>Normalizer: Extract errors
    Normalizer->>Normalizer: Format for tool response
    Normalizer-->>Middleware: Normalized Result
    
    Middleware->>Middleware: Log result
    deactivate Middleware
    
    Middleware-->>FastMCP: Tool result
    FastMCP-->>Transport: JSON-RPC response
    Transport-->>Client: { contentType, text }
